<title>USA: Soros says has no money in Vinik hedge fund.</title>
<headline>Soros says has no money in Vinik hedge fund.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>International financier George Soros has placed no money in former Fidelity Investments fund manager Jeff Vinik's hedge fund, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>Soros' Quantum funds have &quot;placed no money with Mr. Vinik,&quot; said Shawn Pattison.</p>
<p>Sources in the investment community said Vinik's hedge fund, Vinik Asset Management, raised about $800 million from institutional and wealthy clients and will begin investing the funds on Friday.</p>
<p>Some hedge fund watchers and news reports had speculated that Soros was among the first investors in Vinik's fund.</p>
<p>-- Boston bureau (617) 367-4176</p>
